OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated residents return home as
OL,4,Acordon lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Rachel Hale, 35, appeared at
OL,7,FSheffield Magistrates' Court charged
OL,8,Fwith an offence under the Explosive
OL,9,FSubstances Act 1883 and was remanded in
OL,10,Fcustody.
OL,12,FAt about 18:00 BST on Wednesday, South
OL,13,FYorkshire Police said the cordon had
OL,14,Fbeen lifted and neighbours could return
OL,15,Fhome after it was established there was
OL,16,F"no longer a risk" to the area.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
